{
  "buildCommand": "npx prisma generate && tsx scripts/check-env.ts && next build",
  "installCommand": "npm install",
  "framework": "nextjs",
  "regions": ["gru1"],
  "//": [
    "INSTRUÇÕES DE DEPLOY:",
    "1. Push para GitHub",
    "2. Acessar vercel.com e importar repositório",
    "3. Adicionar Environment Variables:",
    "   - DATABASE_URL (connection string do Neon com pooler)",
    "   - DIRECT_URL (connection string direta do Neon)",
    "   - NEXTAUTH_URL (URL do projeto na Vercel)",
    "   - NEXTAUTH_SECRET (gerar com: openssl rand -base64 32)",
    "   - NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL (mesma que NEXTAUTH_URL)",
    "4. Deploy automático em cada push para main"
  ]
}
